+**Superseded in part by the two amendments above:** the round-1 paragraph's `on_backwards="merge"` / `backwards_packets_merged` and its "IQR > 1 s" application bound no longer exist (rounds 2-3 replace them with the `on_late` policy and the feasible-interval width rule), and its re-smoke line "applied +1.220 s" is no longer what the CLI does - see the round-3 re-smoke below.
